# Frigate, speedrun route. Agent: plant the tracker bug on the helicopter (objective 3), free the hostages (objective
# 0: two escapes are needed on Agent - their captors, AI list 0x403, shot first), out by re-entering pad 153's room.
name frigate
obj=3 gadget bug obj 0
obj=0 hunt ai 0x403
obj=0 hunt
auto
goto pad 153 60
exit
